  "terms": "Terms and privacy",
  "termsBody": "Sokoni Driver connects independent drivers with Sokoni customers and shops. You confirm the documents you upload are yours and valid, you carry orders with care, you hand an order over only after the customer's PIN is accepted, and you keep your vehicle roadworthy and legal. Sokoni records your location only while you are online or on a delivery, keeps delivery route points for 72 hours to resolve disputes, and shows your name, photo, vehicle and phone to the customer only during their delivery. Your NIDA number is stored encrypted and your documents are seen only by the Sokoni team that checks drivers. Sokoni may suspend accounts for fraud, unsafe driving or repeated cancellations. Contact support@sokoni.co.tz with any question."
